---
description: Rules for React pages and UI components
globs: components/**/*.js,components/**/*.jsx,components/**/*.tsx,app/**/*.js
alwaysApply: false
---
- Pages and most components are `"use client"`. Lazy-load heavy children with `next/dynamic` + `LoadingSpinner`.
- Authenticated pages: `export default Protected(Page)` (components/Protected.js). Org-wide data is already loaded by app/org/[org_id]/layout.js.
- Read state with `useCustomSelector` from @/customHooks/customSelector, never `useSelector`. Mutate via thunks in store/action/.
- NEVER import or call config/* APIs from components or pages. Flow is always: dispatch an action (store/action/) → the action calls the API (config/) → the action dispatches a reducer → the component reads via useCustomSelector. Enforced by ESLint no-restricted-imports.
- Modals: wrap in `<Modal MODAL_ID={MODAL_TYPE.X} title=…>` (components/UI/Modal.jsx). Add the ID to MODAL_TYPE in utils/enums.js. Open and close with `openModal`/`closeModal` from utils/utility.js, not useState.
- Sliders: reuse components/sliders/* with `toggleSidebar(id)`.
- Deletes: `useDeleteOperation` + components/UI/DeleteModal.jsx.
- Reuse primitives first: Dropdown, SearchItems, ConfirmationModal (components/UI/), CustomTable, PageHeader, InfoTooltip. See docs/ai/COMPONENTS.md.
- Give interactive elements a kebab-case `id` / `data-testid` prefixed by the component.
- Follow docs/AI_INSTRUCTIONS.md: one primary CTA, cards below 15 items and a table at 15+, empty states explain the next action, AI actions show idle/thinking/done.
- Files over about 400 lines: split into sub-components in a subfolder.
- Hooks lint rules are disabled. Check dependency arrays and never call hooks conditionally.
- Reference: @components/modals/TemplateNameModal.js
